eal para la toma de decisiones operativas y directivas.", "short_description": "AVCXR es una plataforma inmersiva de realidad mixta enfocada en revolucionar la capacitaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica en los sectores de Educaci\u00f3n, Salud e Industria.\nEl impacto principal del proyecto es la democratizaci\u00f3n y descentralizaci\u00f3n del aprendizaje: mediante el uso de laboratorios remotos y m\u00f3dulos did\u00e1cticos inmersivos, AVCXR lleva oportunidades de educaci\u00f3n superior y entrenamiento en procesos industriales directamente a zonas rurales y comunidades vulnerables de dif\u00edcil acceso"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "26575577285407797", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_26575577292074463_8179618092863187677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b0MAK-P3ttwQ7kNvwGfpKZE&_nc_oc=AdrPmcy0q4uNuBSIdQhbEcdRd4wXDCpB74cm0c7eHL8zF-vVeM06YRevrElb_Kbkb1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJHpJyEuSL5Zf_k1hIe8kBntRJmFk4cgXxtnpeTJbkhw&oe=6ABA8E9E"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "3056063914782038", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_3056063918115371_2202158384151631148_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_YWSl9xQaZUQ7kNvwFGrLWj&_nc_oc=Adqfxtf9insdVwUK7dmA4UT5Tg_PtgNGAB4RgNN4tIBFos80tly6Kfj4FuKoX7gjy2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK4fvMQH-jvg7wwS_OOkH7V-VflNxoh7T8weHkgnNUl3w&oe=6ABA664F"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest_portrait.png", "id": "2473565366496707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296057_2473565369830040_7720233636311648977_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3ThLdfnJeYQ7kNvwF41PhM&_nc_oc=AdoqHlUFCKFW_1rzVv46faa169PFMn2y0x6YG4hRaGmaIntwt4vDJEzUvU2JmbAHYiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscd